# Tests that the CEK continuation stack depth limit produces a ResourceLimitExceeded error.
# Uses a recursive countdown that pushes one continuation frame per step.
# With MAX_CONTINUATION_STACK = 8192, a depth > 8192 must trigger the error.
[
  count-down: [fn [let n]
    [if [= n 0]
      "done"
      [count-down [- n 1]]]]
  result: [count-down 9000]
]
=== error
continuation stack depth exceeded
